{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46885","headline":"寄吴国西供奉 · 齐己","name":"寄吴国西供奉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别来相忆梦多迷，君住东朝我楚西。\n瑶阙合陪龙象位，春山休记鹧鸪啼。\n承恩位与千官别，应制才将十子齐。\n几笑远公慵送客，殷懃只到寺前溪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46885.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46885","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}